rom_target" cx="1" ccx="0" in="3" churn="2" amp="3" tested="1"><doc>The part of a core region inside the picture, as a normalized rectangle</doc>pub fn rect_from_target(region: &amp;TargetRegion) -&gt; Option&lt;NormalizedRect&gt;</d></f><f p="/Users/michael/Code/deadpan/crates/deadpan-app/src/navigation/camera.rs"><d l="87" n="from_geometry" id="/Users/michael/Code/deadpan/crates/deadpan-app/src/navigation/camera.rs::RegionDraft::from_geometry" cx="3" ccx="1" in="1" churn="3" amp="1">pub fn from_geometry(geometry: TargetGeometry, kind_locked: bool) -&gt; Self</d></f></sigs><bodies shown="6" total="6" capped="0"><b t="fn" l="1201" p="/Users/michael/Code/deadpan/crates/deadpan-cli/src/tracking.rs" n="target_rect_at"><![CDATA[pub fn target_rect_at(target: &AttentionTarget, at: i64) -> Option<NormalizedRect> {
